# incident.io

> incident.io is an all-in-one incident management platform unifying on-call scheduling, real-time incident response, AI-powered automation, and integrated status pages – helping teams resolve issues faster and reduce downtime.

incident.io helps engineering teams manage incidents from start to finish, with deep Slack and Microsoft Teams integration, automated workflows, AI-assisted investigation and response, and comprehensive on-call management. The platform is designed for modern software teams who want to respond to incidents efficiently while learning from them to prevent future issues.

## Products

- [On-call](https://incident.io/on-call): On-call scheduling and management with AI-powered noise reduction
- [Incident Response from Slack](https://incident.io/incident-response-slack): Real-time incident response from Slack
- [Incident Response from Microsoft Teams](https://incident.io/incident-response-microsoft-teams): Real-time incident response from Microsoft Teams
- [Investigations](https://incident.io/investigations): AI-powered incident investigation, automated PR drafting, and intelligent response suggestions
- [Status Pages](https://incident.io/status-pages): Automated, transparent customer communication during incidents

